  "nvfp4": {
   "_doc": "NVFP4 (modelopt layout): U8 = two e2m1 per byte, F8_E4M3 scale per 16 values, per-expert F32 amax and one outer-scale denominator; GGUF folds amax and the denominator into one F32 .scale per expert (formula: verify). w13 = gate and up rows interleaved (Inkling's reference): whether the GGUF converter de-interleaves them: verify; `gguf_scale` names that derived GGUF tensor (F32 [128]), from amax and outer",
